{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47314","headline":"题龚山人草堂 · 吴筠","name":"题龚山人草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人负一美，未肯甘陆沉。\n独抱匡济器，能怀真隐心。\n结庐迩城郭，及到云木深。\n灭迹慕颍阳，忘机同汉阴。\n啓户面白水，凭轩对苍岑。\n但歌考盘诗，不学梁父吟。\n兹道我所适，感君齐素襟。\n勖哉龚夫子，勿使嚣尘侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}